  "detail": "entity id in payload ('urn:E2') does not match URL ('urn:E1')",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Entity Id Mismatch",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



06. Batch update and batch merge of urn:E2 - not found, urn:E1 untouched
========================================================================
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
